        <mxCell id="A7AM7nD3O5EXVxnJzTEr-13" parent="1" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=25;" value="&lt;b&gt;Repository pattern:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/aspnet/mvc/overview/older-versions/getting-started-with-ef-5-using-mvc-4/implementing-the-repository-and-unit-of-work-patterns-in-an-asp-net-mvc-application&quot;&gt;link&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;Databases are behind a repository layer.&lt;br&gt;DbContext lifetime is controlled in the repository." vertex="1">
